            <ArticleTitle>Growing pains.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1365-72</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the investigation of children with leg aches, it is essential to identify any underlying organic disease. Growing pain is a poorly named, nebulous entity that can be diagnosed only by exclusion. The greatest diagnostic error is to make a diagnosis of growing pains while overlooking some serious underlying condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
